    "qualified_prefix": "For entry ESP=T and ESI=V, PUSH ESI writes V at SS:[T-4] and leaves ESP=T-4. The first E8 then writes return address C05234 at SS:[T-8] and transfers to C051B7 with ESP=T-8. These relations do not continue across the opaque callee.",
